    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use Swift macros that generate additional properties and add protocol conformance for your app intent implementation.",
      "ko": "Swift 매크로를 사용하면 앱 인텐트 구현에서 추가 속성을 생성하고 protocol 적합성을 추가할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "89ae9f718a492020d200f02f2ad9192b36d239837924066a74daf45bab178f3f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "The following example shows an app intent that conforms to the `.spreadsheet.updateSheet` schema:",
      "ko": "다음 예제는 `.spreadsheet.updateSheet` 스키마를 준수하는 앱 인텐트를 보여줍니다.\n```swift\n@AppIntent(schema: .spreadsheet.updateSheet)\nstruct UpdateSheetIntent: AppIntent {\n    @Parameter\n    var target: SheetEntity\n\n    @Parameter\n    var name: String?\n\n    @Parameter\n    var position: Int?\n\n    func perform() async throws -> some IntentResult {\n        .result()\n    }\n```",
      "sourceHash": "9ba9a5de784590ffe4088635d73774a3cebf3c2c155615956c76455594e2a58b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "```swift\n@AppIntent(schema: .spreadsheet.updateSheet)\nstruct UpdateSheetIntent: AppIntent {\n    @Parameter\n    var target: SheetEntity\n\n    @Parameter\n    var name: String?\n\n    @Parameter\n    var position: Int?\n\n    func perform() async throws -> some IntentResult {\n        .result()\n    }\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\n@AppIntent(schema: .spreadsheet.updateSheet)\nstruct UpdateSheetIntent: AppIntent {\n    @Parameter\n    var target: SheetEntity\n\n    @Parameter\n    var name: String?\n\n    @Parameter\n    var position: Int?\n\n    func perform() async throws -> some IntentResult {\n        .result()\n    }\n```",
      "sourceHash": "98cdc48c6d1c7057e278fca7c9925e28c30cccbef986406714e3338653c86ca9",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "For more information about the `.spreadsheet` app intent domain, see [`Making spreadsheet actions available to Siri and Apple Intelligence`](making-spreadsheet-actions-available-to-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md).",
      "ko": "`.spreadsheet` 앱 인텐트 도메인에 대한 자세한 내용은 [`Making spreadsheet actions available to Siri and Apple Intelligence`](making-spreadsheet-actions-available-to-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md)에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "671cdea531a4cdd6c0c58ae9c2697064e99fef105b591f54144994724eebe73d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "For general information about app intent domains, see [`Integrating actions with Siri and Apple Intelligence`](integrating-actions-with-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md).",
      "ko": "앱 인텐트 도메인에 대한 일반적인 정보는 [`Integrating actions with Siri and Apple Intelligence`](integrating-actions-with-siri-and-apple-intelligence.md)에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
